add(426,[431],[27],'002-035','762–766','variation enE,X','A finite-field extensionF_p→F_{p^r} replacesF byF^r, preservingχ and raisingδ to therth power.','open on the pages','E','The tested base-extension case is elementary Frobenius linear algebra within the trace formalism. The author’s wider variation problem is not exhausted by this case.','Grothendieck1964Lefschetz','LF-S01','CALC-05','The stated test is proved; variation in arbitraryE,X remains a broader problem, with local epsilon theory relevant to curves.')
